# Allowlist: the image build needs exactly these inputs. README.md and
# LICENSE are required because pyproject.toml declares them as `readme`
# and `license-files` — the wheel build fails without them.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src

# ...but never bytecode caches from inside src/.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
